File "layout_any_return_effect_unknown_result.ml", lines 24-26, characters 4-34:
24 | ....match f () with
25 |     | x -> x
26 |     | effect E, k -> continue k ()
Error: The result of a match or try expression with effect handlers
       must have a value layout.
       The layout of a is any
         because of the annotation on the abstract type declaration for a.
       But the layout of a must be a value layout
         because it's the result of a match or try expression with effect handlers.
